# Where the CRA dev-server proxies /api (see src/setupProxy.js).
# On Looper set this on the tic-tac-toe (client) runner; the template resolves
# to whatever port the score-api runner actually got, even after a remap.
# A bare port ({{tic-tac-toe-score-api.port}}) or host:port is accepted too.
BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:{{tic-tac-toe-score-api.port}}
